WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:09.517
Welcome to PollSlide! In the next two minutes, you'll make your first quiz, let Polly write questions for you, add GIFs, and run it live with your audience.

2
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:17.853
Start by choosing what to make. Polls ask the room what it thinks. Quizzes have right answers and a leaderboard. Let's make a quiz.

3
00:00:18.806 --> 00:00:23.088
Click Blank Quiz, and give it a name. Everything you do saves automatically.

4
00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:33.055
Now add your first question. Type it in, fill in the answers, then tick the right one. Polls work exactly the same way, just without a right answer.

5
00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:45.490
Now make it fun. Tap GIF, search for anything you like, and pick one for your question. Each answer can have its own GIF too. They look great on the big screen, and on everyone's phone.

6
00:00:51.167 --> 00:01:02.729
Short on time? Ask Polly. Describe your topic, choose how many questions, and Polly writes them for you, with the right answers already marked. Free accounts get five Polly drafts a month.

7
00:01:04.994 --> 00:01:16.142
Want pictures everywhere? Open the deck menu, choose GIFs, and PollSlide finds one for every question and answer. Safe search is always on, and you review them before anyone sees them.

8
00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:32.512
When you're ready, press Present. Your audience scans the QR code with their phones. No app, no sign up. Answers appear live as they come in. Then reveal the answer, and see who got it right!

9
00:01:43.452 --> 00:01:50.954
That's it! Open PollSlide and make your first quiz today. And if you ever need a hand, just email help at pollslide dot com.
